<title>POLAND: Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight stocks rose, one fell and nine were flat in 9.6-million zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units eased 0.3 percent to 154.5 zlotys in an 8.8-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
